      "description": "SECONDARY estimator: EnergyRemaining / BatteryLevel during rest hours (battery_health_diagnostics). Noisier and SOC-dependent; shown for context. The headline capacity and the health score use the weekly full-charge estimator (see 'Weekly Full-Charge Peak').",
