      "description": "EXPERIMENTAL. Method adapted from Packfade (https://github.com/pgodlews/packfade, MIT licence) by the same author.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Experimental.** For each drive: energy that left the pack (pack voltage × current, integrated) ÷ share of SOC used = apparent capacity. A robust log-linear trend through those drives (temperature-adjusted, Huber-weighted, day-clustered bootstrap) gives the index.\n\nRelies on the BMS SOC (LFP drift between full charges); 30 s current sampling; not a capacity test; not in the health score.\n\nMethod adapted from [Packfade](https://github.com/pgodlews/packfade) (MIT) by the same author."
      }
    },
